## Third-party notices

The following files under `scripts/` are derived from
[NousResearch/hermes-agent](https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent),
path `skills/productivity/microsoft-office/`, which is released under the MIT
License, Copyright (c) 2026 Nous Research:

- `docx_common.py` — unchanged
- `docx_create.py`
- `docx_edit.py`
- `docx_read.py`
- `docx_validate.py`
- `docx_comments.py`
- `docx_revisions.py`
- `docx_template.py`

Local modifications to those files are limited to an added `sys.path`
bootstrap header, a UTF-8 stdio import, and the portability/bug fixes noted in
the commit history. The original MIT grant above applies to them unchanged.

The remaining modules are original work:

- `_bootstrap.py`, `encoding_fix.py`, `docx_pack.py`, `docx_utils.py`
- `linear_to_latex.py`, `math_omml.py`, `docx_mathify.py`, `insert_formula.py`
- `table_width.py`, `template.py`

`MML2OMML.XSL` is a Microsoft Office component. It is used at runtime from a
local Office installation and is **not** redistributed here.
